    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Story mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Follow the story of Sophie who is taking over her grandmother Celeste's cheese shop after her unexpected death. Watch  Cheese Party come back to life, meet the locals of a seaside town as you progress through the levels. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Skip story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If story isn't for you, skip the story in one click to use the skip button.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish  puzzles  leaving no cheese  on the board to win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on fun levels without interruption. Complete the level to move on to the next, fail and you go back a level. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and upload your own Cheese party levels and story with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Power ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help you; move cheese diagonally, move cheese 2 tiles, sticky cheese move cheese on the board without making a match. Power ups are rewarded randomly for 3 star scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy  the game. No pay to win or micro transactions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese party is the first indie game created by Raincode. Raincode is a game dev family made up of self taught artists and  developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/0e2f7b48a8e6bba19cb8daf7869b9e15.poster.avif?t=1750070325\" width=620 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/0e2f7b48a8e6bba19cb8daf7869b9e15.webm?t=1750070325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Story mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Follow the story of Sophie who is taking over her grandmother Celeste's cheese shop after her unexpected death. Watch  Cheese Party come back to life, meet the locals of a seaside town as you progress through the levels. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Skip story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If story isn't for you, skip the story in one click to use the skip button.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish  puzzles  leaving no cheese  on the board to win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on fun levels without interruption. Complete the level to move on to the next, fail and you go back a level. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and upload your own Cheese party levels and story with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Power ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help you; move cheese diagonally, move cheese 2 tiles, sticky cheese move cheese on the board without making a match. Power ups are rewarded randomly for 3 star scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy  the game. No pay to win or micro transactions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese party is the first indie game created by Raincode. Raincode is a game dev family made up of self taught artists and  developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/0e2f7b48a8e6bba19cb8daf7869b9e15.poster.avif?t=1750070325\" width=620 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/0e2f7b48a8e6bba19cb8daf7869b9e15.webm?t=1750070325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
